    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各颜色通道（0–255）与点击颜色相差多少仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化从各边缘向内延伸的距离（像素）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在亮度方向上影响的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在色相方向上影响的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在饱和度方向上影响的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的程度（像素）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度在置换线条前的平滑程度，从尖锐的脊线到圆润的丘状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向邻近像素扩散的程度。较低时区域更平坦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线填充空隙的程度；较暗的部分线条更细"
