    "Open “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“%@”？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option temporarily selects the eyedropper in painting tools. Shift constrains shapes/movement or adds to a selection; Option subtracts from selections or draws from center. Command-drag moves selected pixels; Command-Option-drag copies them. Option-drag duplicates layers/folders/effects; Option-click at a layer boundary toggles clipping. Command-click a thumbnail loads its selection. Control bypasses snapping. Right-drag adjusts brush size. Modifier-and-mouse gestures are fixed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在绘画工具中，按住 Option 可临时切换到吸管。Shift 用于约束形状/移动方向，或加选；Option 用于减选，或从中心绘制。按住 Command 拖动可移动所选像素；Command-Option 拖动则复制它们。Option 拖动可复制图层/文件夹/效果；在图层边界处 Option 点击可切换剪贴蒙版。Command 点击缩览图可载入其选区。Control 可绕过吸附。拖动时按右键可调整画笔大小。修饰键与鼠标的手势组合是固定的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click to set the source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Option 点击以设置源点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click to set the source · Drag to clone · [ ] size · Shift-[ ] hardness · 1–0 opacity · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option 单击以设置源点 · 拖动以仿制 · [ ] 调整大小 · Shift-[ ] 调整硬度 · 按 1–0 调整不透明度 · 空格键平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click where Clone Stamp should copy from first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先按住 Option 点击，以设置仿制图章的复制源点。"
