    "Targeted Adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment: drag on the image to change that color's saturation, or its hue with Command held": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整：在图像上拖动以更改该颜色的饱和度，按住 Command 则更改色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色温"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Editing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框沿用 macOS 标准编辑键。对话框沿用上文的「应用/取消」设定。数值框使用上下方向键，按住 Shift 步长更大。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出、⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录制时始终使用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 双击以编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑快捷键需要搭配 Command、Option 或 Control，以免取代正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区细节过多，无法描边。请调整容差，或开启“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大。形状最多可覆盖 %lld 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文本框超出 %@ 像素或 %lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的处理方式。校准可达到版本 6 的大部分强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取 Photoshop 文件。它可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状图层不支持 Photoshop 描边，已忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop text warp was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已忽略 Photoshop 文字变形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以这么长的牵引跟随指针，让手抖时也能画出平滑的线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试使用更小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置都会选取墨色最贴合其影调的字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝的图层超出此项目的 %lld 百万像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装字体“%@”，因此文字以系统字体绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be encoded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法编码图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be read. It may be damaged or unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取图像。它可能已损坏或不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版无法转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask is turned off. Shift-click its thumbnail to turn it on, then paint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版已关闭。按住 Shift 点击其缩览图以开启，然后绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The object mask could not be rendered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染对象蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能对象已被栅格化。链接的内容无法编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trimmed image dimensions are invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裁切后的图像尺寸无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough memory to make that selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存不足，无法建立该选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These layers supply live masks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thickness": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粗细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Layer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a format version Compositor can’t read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Photoshop 文件使用的格式版本 Compositor 无法读取。"
